     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The next 4 bits are the index."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "bits[8..=11]"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "p_idx"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "And the lowest 4 bits are the offset."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "bits[12..=15]"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "p_off"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Now read each field as a number."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "fields"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The offset 1100 is 8 plus 4, which is 12: byte 12 of the block."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "fields[2]"
      },
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "fields[2][3]",
       "value": "12"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The index 0111 is 4 plus 2 plus 1, which is 7: line 7."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "fields[1]"
      },
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "fields[1][3]",
       "value": "7"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "The tag 0001 1010 is 16 plus 8 plus 2, which is 26."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "fields[0]"
      },
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "fields[0][3]",
       "value": "26"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Check with arithmetic: the block number is 6780 divided by 16, which is 423, and 423 mod 16 is 7."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark",
       "target": "fields[1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "So the index really is the block number mod 16, read straight from the bits."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "mark",
       "target": "fields[0..=2]"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "identify",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 5, question two: how does the cache know the block in line 7 is ours?"
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "hex"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "bits"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "fields"
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "head"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 5 of 7: Q2 identification"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "lines"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Many blocks share line 7: every block whose number mod 16 is 7."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "lines[2]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "So each line stores a tag, the part of the address the index did not use."
